    <p style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,212,255,0.55);margin:0;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;">— VANHOOZER, Kevin J. <em>The Drama of Doctrine.</em> Louisville: Westminster John Knox Press, 2005. p. 115.</p>
